        "shaderType": 0,
        "hlslSource": "// Multiplies its input's colour by Gain: the test plugin's effect.\nTexture2D Source : register(t0);\nSamplerState InputSampler : register(s0);\ncbuffer Constants : register(b0) { float Gain; };\nfloat4 main(float4 pos : SV_POSITION, float4 scenePos : SCENE_POSITION,\n            float4 uv0 : TEXCOORD0) : SV_TARGET\n{\n    float4 color = Source.Sample(InputSampler, uv0.xy);\n    return float4(color.rgb * Gain, color.a);\n}\n",
